{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_236_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，王正月，宋公入曹，以曹伯陽歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"二、吳伐我。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊人取讙及闡。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"惡內也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"四、歸邾子益於邾。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"益之名，失國也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"六、冬，十有二月，癸亥，杞伯過卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_236_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_236","textTraditional":"七、齊人歸讙及闡。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}